.SH NAME
cbor::error, cbor::category, cbor::error_category, cbor::make_error_code, std::is_error_code_enum<cbor::error>, cbor::limits \- the error values of the library, their conversion to std::error_code, and the limits of a build
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IP
